Q2. Explain the difference between private, default,
protected and public using a package example.

Interview Ready Answer

Package Structure

com.bank

    Account.java
    Customer.java

com.payment

    Payment.java
    SavingsAccount.java extends Account

------------------------------------------------------------

private

• Accessible only inside the same class.

Example

private double balance;

Accessible By

Account          ✔
Customer         ✘
Payment          ✘
SavingsAccount   ✘

------------------------------------------------------------

default (Package-Private)

• Accessible only within the same package.

Example

String accountType;

Accessible By

Account          ✔
Customer         ✔
Payment          ✘
SavingsAccount   ✘

------------------------------------------------------------

protected

• Accessible within the same package.
• Accessible in subclasses outside the package
  through inheritance.

Example

protected void calculateInterest(){}

Accessible By

Account          ✔
Customer         ✔
Payment          ✘
SavingsAccount   ✔

------------------------------------------------------------

public

• Accessible from anywhere.

Example

public void deposit(){}

Accessible By

Account          ✔
Customer         ✔
Payment          ✔
SavingsAccount   ✔

